<p>Lebanese health authorities said an Israeli strike hit a health center in southern Lebanon on Saturday, killing at least 12 medical workers. The health ministry described it as the second attack on the health sector within a few hours, after another strike on Sawaneh. The strike came as the regional conflict worsened, shortly after Hezbollah leader Naim Qassem said the group was prepared for a long confrontation with Israel. The deaths highlight the growing danger facing medical workers and civilians in southern Lebanon as cross-border hostilities intensify.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/MeW-FJpXSp3U5lqO6Vmv3_djXCwu_y5rVMEKvbJ5HGNLU-9NUHpM-Jwb15owgGuP8Zx9dS9wDwVGhML1DPiIyLhxyejgBytkR56_n8GdifvHwpSp1uYhbj1UpMdQ0U1tcOniinxh7ul_tayU3pSqN4G08g5enk1zFmZYThlNUVm298UmxBrKDllrETlgT9ZtfzyZW7p--t_su7jCasG-nd-tvgzmTl4cHBRyb-2vS4sd_REPwhXUyuBhZcBag9rMvQee' alt='Scene from southern Lebanon during the latest escalation.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Conflicting toll: Firstpost&#x27;s headline said 11 deaths, while its description said a dozen, unlike other outlets. The mismatch is a reminder that early casualty counts often differ in breaking conflict coverage.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/south-lebanon-healthcare-centre-israeli-strike-medical-staff-killed/article70741306.ece'>At least 12 medical staff killed in Israeli strike on health centre in southern Lebanon: ministry</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/lebanon-says-israeli-strike-in-south-kills-12-medics'>Lebanon says Israeli strike in south kills 12 medics amid escalating Middle East conflict</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/lebanon-says-israeli-strike-south-kills-12-medics'>Lebanon says Israeli strike in south kills 12 medics</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/lebanon-claims-israels-strike-on-countrys-south-kills-1